{"title": "Sword of Justice", "pageid": 3341, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sword_of_Justice", "categories": ["Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Martial weapons", "Greatswords", "Uncommon items", "Sources of Slashing damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sword_of_Justice_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Sword_of_Justice_Icon.png/300px-Sword_of_Justice_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/db/Sword_of_Justice_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Sword of Justice image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Sword_of_Justice_Icon.png/300px-Sword_of_Justice_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Sword_of_Justice_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Sword of Justice</span></a> is an uncommon +1 <a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\">greatsword</a> that grants its wielder the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tyr%27s_Protection\" title=\"Tyr's Protection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/38px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/50px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tyr's Protection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tyr%27s_Protection\" title=\"Tyr's Protection\">Tyr's Protection</a> spell.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The words 'Deliverance. Justice. Vengeance.' are engraved on the base of this sword. They echo in your mind.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/D6_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">2d6 + 1 (3~13) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Greatswords_Icon.png/25px-Greatswords_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Greatswords_Icon.png/38px-Greatswords_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Greatswords_Icon.png/50px-Greatswords_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greatswords\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Greatswords_Icon.png/25px-Greatswords_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Greatswords_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\">Greatswords</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span c